  "description": "For each constant expression [1/0 ;; 1\\0 ;; 1 Mod 0 ;; 0/0 ;; 1.5/0 ;; CDbl(1)/0 ;; CInt(1)/0 ;; CLng(1)\\0 ;; CInt(1)\\0 ;; 1/0.0 ;; CByte(300) ;; CInt(40000) ;; CLng(2147483647)+CLng(1) ;; CInt(32767)*CInt(2) ;; 2147483647*2147483647 ;; CInt('q') ;; CLng('q') ;; 'q'+7 ;; 'q'*7 ;; 'q'-7 ;; -'q' ;; Val('q')/0 ;; Sqr(-1) ;; Log(0) ;; Left('ab', -1)]: SELECT e FROM One as a snapshot, then the field's Value read. Gives, per expression, whether ACE fails at OpenRecordset or at the Value read; one operator or operand type varies at a time. The fixture copy is opened read-only.",
